  "altTitles": [
   {
    "en": "Take Good Care of What You Pick Up A Man Favored by a Wolf Pup - A Story of His Journey to Another World"
   },
   {
    "ja": "拾ったものは大切にしましょう 子狼に気に入られた男の転移物語"
   }
